          "q": "Is an opossum under my Connecticut deck dangerous?",
          "a": "Usually not — opossums are slow, non-aggressive, and good tick eaters, and one passing through the yard is best left alone. One denning under a deck or in a crawlspace is different: it fouls the space and may have young there, so call us and we will confirm what is underneath before trapping."
