          "a": "The opossum is an NWCS-authorized species in Rhode Island, so hired opossum work runs under an NWCS permit. Rhode Island bars moving a live-caught mammal off the property, so our framing is humane trapping or eviction at the den on site, cleanup of the fouled space, and sealing the bulkhead, vent, or foundation gap it used — the outcome happens at your property, because that is what the state's rules require."
